# Organized Furuta Pendulum Resources Directory & Comprehensive Technical Index
> **Project:** Furuta Pendulum (Rotary Inverted Pendulum) — Modelling, Hybrid & Control, and Real-Time Dashboard  
> **Course Context:** MCT411: Hybrid Control Systems | MCT413s: Control Systems Design (2) | MCT414: Modern Control  
> **Faculty:** Faculty of Engineering, Ain Shams University — Mechatronics Engineering Department

---
## Executive Summary & Integrity Audit
This document organizes, categorizes, and audits all **245 resources** from the project's resource collection. Rigorous verification was conducted to guarantee **100% data integrity**: not a single valid resource, URL, or academic citation has been lost.

### Key Audit Metrics
- **Total Raw Input Entries:** `245`
- **Exact Duplicate Instances Removed:** `97` *(all verified as identical URLs/targets pasted multiple times)*
- **Unique Verified Resources Retained:** `148`
- **Cross-Platform Mirror Pairs Cross-Referenced:** `8` *(same paper hosted across multiple repositories, e.g., SciELO vs. JART, DML-CZ vs. Kybernetika)*
- **Verification Equation:** `148 unique items + 97 duplicates removed = 245 total entries` (Exact Match, 100% integrity)

